# blp_27_3_3: [[27,3,3]] bivariate tricycle code (d3_blp of arXiv:2510.07269), G = Z3 x Z3,
#   A = x + x^2 y, B = x^2 y + x^2 y^2, C = 1 + x y^2. Three blocks, 54 physical CCZs.
# Z-syndrome round and CCZ triples are the authors' (zsyn_27_3_3_3blocks.stim, ccz_27_3_3_depth2.npy,
# identical to github.com/tinghui2012/transversal-dimension-jump notebook 3); the feed-forward X correction,
# real CCZ gates (tsim syntax), final MX, detectors and observables were added.
# Noise: DEPOLARIZE1(0.001) on Z-ancillas after reset and before MR, DEPOLARIZE2(0.001) after each CX,
# E(0.001) weight-5 Z per data qubit after the CCZ, DEPOLARIZE1(0.001) on data before MX.
